  "details": "With the upcoming age verification, the Groups feature is something that many clubs would like to try out for an orderly entry to the venue.\n\nStill, currently the problem is that you cannot change the roles after an instance has been already created. This would be an excellent feature for the future so club management would be much easier and you don't need a host account for that anymore.\n\nWhat do I mean with that? I will take a rave event as an exaple:\n\n1. Create a Group instance with only staff (Role \"Staff\") allowed access\n\n2. Set up the instance to the group's liking\n\n3. Change the Group instance settings, allowing normal guests (Role \"Attendees\") access to the already open instance\n\nI think that this would help a lot of venue owners to manage the flow of the event.",
